{"3984090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Night of the Living Bubble", "steam_appid": 3984090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5135650], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT YOUR AVERAGE NIGHT SHIFT... One fateful night when clocking into work at your local RRH (Rugs, Rags and Handsoaps!). You find that your store and local outlet mall has been overrun by sentient monsters borne from the products of the shelves. Constructed by an evil mad scientist bent on world domination, only YOU can stop the onslaught of monsters and save the world by using your trusty-store issued Nailgun. Welcome to Night of the Living Bubble.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, shoot, flame, bomb and swing over enemies as you use everyday tools and appliances to survive and destroy the spawn nests that plague your place of business. Make sure you move quick though as the bubbles, stuffed animals and other sentient creatures don't wait for you to catch your breath in this action packed first person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this experience you explore several beautifully handcrafted levels whilst using your provided tools to destroy the spawners that are bringing these creatures to life. Fight using your trusty Nailgun, shaken up soda grenades and other home appliance tools as you beat back the horde, reclaim the outlet mall and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game started as an project in <strong>January 2025 as a part of Global Game Jam</strong>. Initially started by a small team of 5 people which quickly became 6, the team have worked around the clock on this project in parallel to class and managing jobs. This game was a huge effort from the devs and all who helped to contribute and make this project possible.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT YOUR AVERAGE NIGHT SHIFT... One fateful night when clocking into work at your local RRH (Rugs, Rags and Handsoaps!). You find that your store and local outlet mall has been overrun by sentient monsters borne from the products of the shelves. Constructed by an evil mad scientist bent on world domination, only YOU can stop the onslaught of monsters and save the world by using your trusty-store issued Nailgun. Welcome to Night of the Living Bubble.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/1235e11a8335b2e13e2369dffd39cd0f.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, shoot, flame, bomb and swing over enemies as you use everyday tools and appliances to survive and destroy the spawn nests that plague your place of business. Make sure you move quick though as the bubbles, stuffed animals and other sentient creatures don't wait for you to catch your breath in this action packed first person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/bfb707cd960369287be3dac0befc14ba.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this experience you explore several beautifully handcrafted levels whilst using your provided tools to destroy the spawners that are bringing these creatures to life. Fight using your trusty Nailgun, shaken up soda grenades and other home appliance tools as you beat back the horde, reclaim the outlet mall and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.poster.avif?t=1787876212\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.webm?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984090/extras/4573c17139f1eb545226ef8cd324e1fc.mp4?t=1787876212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game started as an project in <strong>January 2025 as a part of Global Game Jam</strong>. Initially started by a small team of 5 people which quickly became 6, the team have worked around the clock on this project in parallel to class and managing jobs. This game was a huge effort from the devs and all who helped to contribute and make this project possible.</p>", "short_description": "NOT YOUR AVERAGE NIGHT SHIFT... When clocking into work, you find that your business has been overrun by monsters borne from the products on the she